        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SportsBlitz is a fast-paced, retro-inspired microgame collection where every second counts. Jump between dozens of bite-sized sports challenges, each lasting only a few frantic moments, as you race to win rounds, avoid elimination, and climb the leaderboard. Every game throws you into a new skill test: fencing duels, top-down dodging, quick-reaction inputs, and more, all wrapped in a nostalgic CRT-TV presentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to learn but chaotic to master, SportsBlitz delivers classic WarioWare-style energy with a distinct pixel-sports aesthetic. Survive long enough, rack up the wins, and secure your place in the Hall of Fame!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SportsBlitz was made by 6 students for our university project.</p>",
